      "content": "LONDON ROAD 1. 5252                                                   (South Side)                                                   The Swan Inn TL 00 NW 10/189 II 2. C18.  Painted brick and stucco, old tiled hipped roof with eaves cornice.  L plan, 2 storeys.  3 light casement window and canted sashed bay on left, small similar bay to projecting wing on right.  Wooden porch in angle.  Sash window to lst floor on right.  Glazing bars to all windows. Listing NGR: TL0383005891"
